### User Dashboard Summary - Current User
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/api/user/dashboard/summary?from_date=2026-02-01&to_date=2026-02-25&timezone=America/Bogota&group_by=day
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### User Dashboard Summary - Specific User
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/api/user/507f1f77bcf86cd799439011/dashboard/summary?from_date=2026-02-01&to_date=2026-02-25
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### User Dashboard Summary - Last 7 Days
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/api/user/dashboard/summary?from_date=2026-02-18&to_date=2026-02-25&group_by=day
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### User Dashboard Summary - Monthly Grouping
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/api/user/dashboard/summary?from_date=2025-11-01&to_date=2026-02-25&group_by=month
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}

### User Dashboard Batch - KPIs Only
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/api/user/dashboard/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from_date": "2026-02-01",
  "to_date": "2026-02-25",
  "timezone": "America/Bogota",
  "group_by": "day",
  "widgets": ["kpis"]
}

### User Dashboard Batch - KPIs + Timeseries
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/api/user/dashboard/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from_date": "2026-02-01",
  "to_date": "2026-02-25",
  "timezone": "America/Bogota",
  "group_by": "day",
  "widgets": ["kpis", "timeseries"]
}

### User Dashboard Batch - All Widgets
POST http://localhost:8000/v1/api/user/dashboard/batch
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_TOKEN}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "from_date": "2026-02-01",
  "to_date": "2026-02-25",
  "timezone": "America/Bogota",
  "group_by": "day",
  "widgets": ["kpis", "timeseries", "breakdowns"]
}

### User Dashboard Global Summary - Listado de Todos los Usuarios (Admin)
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/api/user/dashboard/global/summary?skip=0&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_ADMIN_TOKEN}}

