### User Dashboard Global Summary - Página 2 (skip=10)
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/api/user/dashboard/global/summary?skip=10&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_ADMIN_TOKEN}}

### User Dashboard Global Summary - 50 usuarios por página
GET http://localhost:8000/v1/api/user/dashboard/global/summary?skip=0&limit=50
Authorization: Bearer {{JWT_ADMIN_TOKEN}}




